    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bubbles the Octopus</strong> puts you in the role of a cute octopus with one goal: to reach the precious pearl \u2013 no matter the cost. But the path is lined with treacherous traps and merciless challenges. Dive into a perilous underwater world, conquer deadly obstacles, and perfect your reflexes to become the ultimate deep-sea survivor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dodge Annoying Traps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472260/extras/726e2b0e22737caa793c1fc69b1eec94.poster.avif?t=1739732578\" width=626 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472260/extras/726e2b0e22737caa793c1fc69b1eec94.webm?t=1739732578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472260/extras/726e2b0e22737caa793c1fc69b1eec94.mp4?t=1739732578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The traps are everywhere \u2013 and they\u2019re so ruthlessly mean that you\u2019ll wonder if the game even likes you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Jump, Slide, Die \u2013 Repeat!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump high, slide low, die miserably \u2013 and do it all over again! Who needs a Plan B when Plan A works so well\u2026 almost every time?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Just Be Better</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if it\u2019s hard.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bubbles the Octopus</strong> puts you in the role of a cute octopus with one goal: to reach the precious pearl \u2013 no matter the cost. But the path is lined with treacherous traps and merciless challenges. Dive into a perilous underwater world, conquer deadly obstacles, and perfect your reflexes to become the ultimate deep-sea survivor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dodge Annoying Traps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472260/extras/726e2b0e22737caa793c1fc69b1eec94.poster.avif?t=1739732578\" width=626 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472260/extras/726e2b0e22737caa793c1fc69b1eec94.webm?t=1739732578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3472260/extras/726e2b0e22737caa793c1fc69b1eec94.mp4?t=1739732578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The traps are everywhere \u2013 and they\u2019re so ruthlessly mean that you\u2019ll wonder if the game even likes you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Jump, Slide, Die \u2013 Repeat!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump high, slide low, die miserably \u2013 and do it all over again! Who needs a Plan B when Plan A works so well\u2026 almost every time?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Just Be Better</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if it\u2019s hard.</p>",
